<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34559" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπυρ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set on fire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				372
			</span></i>:— 
				Med.
			, <i>catch fire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.9.6
			</span></i>; <i>light a fire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				2.24
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				649a26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>set aglow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ψυχὴν ἐμπεπύρευκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Resp.</u>
					474b13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Juv.</u>
				469b16
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>kindle in</i> the body, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερμότητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>GA</u>
					739b10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>roast in</i> or <i>on the fire</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φηγόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					1137
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
